plot←{
    N←{9.1=42 ⎕ATX'⍵'}
    A←{
        2=≢⍴⍵:⍵
        ~(N ⍵)∨(1=≡⍵)∧∧/N¨⍵:⍵
        n←(⊂'name')∊⊃,/⍵.⎕NL-2
        s←{
            'histogram'≡t←⍵ ⎕VGET(⊂'type' 'scatter'):t ⍵.x
            ('box'≡t)∧n:t((⍵ ⎕VGET⊂'name' '')(⊂⍵ ⎕VGET⊂(,'x')(⍵ ⎕VGET⊂(,'y')⍬)))
            'box'≡t:t(⊂⍵ ⎕VGET⊂(,'x')(⍵ ⎕VGET⊂(,'y')⍬))
            l←(⊂'false')≢⍵ ⎕VGET(⊂'showlegend'(⊂'true'))
            n:t((⊂⍵ ⎕VGET⊂'name' ''),⍵.(y x))
            t({0::⍵.y ⋄ ⍵.(y x)}⍵)
        }¨⍵
        1<≢t←∪⊃¨s:⎕SIGNAL 6 ⋄ t←⊃t ⋄ s←⊃∘⌽¨s
        t≡'histogram':s
        (t≡'box')∧0∊80|⎕DR¨∊s:(⊂⊃¨s),⊃∘⌽¨s ⋄ t≡'box':s
        ('bar'≡t)∧~0∊80|⎕DR¨s:⎕SIGNAL 11
        1=≢s:⊃s
        1=≢x←∪⊃∘⌽¨s:(⊂⍣⍺{⊃⍣(2=≢⍵)⊢¯1↓⍵}¨s),x
        1=≢y←∪¯2⊃⍤↑¨s:y,(⊂⍣⍺{2=≢⍵:⊃⌽⍵ ⋄ (¯2↓⍵),¯1↑⍵}¨s)
        s
    }
    ⍺←() ⋄ draw←textdraw
    ~N ⍺:⍺ draw.plot 0 A ⍵
    0≠⍺.⎕NC'type':a∇⍵ ⎕VSET¨⊂⊂'type'(⍺.type)⊣a.⎕EX'type'⊣a←⎕NS ⍺
    w←('stack'≡⍺ ⎕VGET⊂'barmode' 'group')A ⍵ ⋄ nl←⍺.⎕NL-2
    ∧/'height' 'width'∊nl:⍺.(height width)draw.plot w
    (⊂'height')∊nl:⍺.height draw.plot w
    (⊂'width')∊nl:⍺.width draw.plot w
    draw.plot w
}
